{
  "id": "conveyor-batch",
  "order": 18,
  "level": 4,
  "plant": "conveyor",
  "title": {
    "es": "Cinta que se detiene cada 3 cajas",
    "en": "Belt that stops every 3 boxes"
  },
  "statement": {
    "es": [
      "MARCHA (I0.0) pone en movimiento la CINTA (Q0.0). El SENSOR (I0.2, lo maneja la planta) detecta cada caja que pasa. Cuando pasan 3 cajas, la cinta se detiene sola y se enciende LOTE_LISTO (Q0.1).",
      "REINICIAR (I0.1) pone la cuenta en cero y apaga LOTE_LISTO; después, MARCHA empieza el siguiente lote."
    ],
    "en": [
      "START (I0.0) sets the BELT (Q0.0) moving. The SENSOR (I0.2, driven by the plant) detects every box that passes. When 3 boxes have passed, the belt stops by itself and BATCH_READY (Q0.1) turns on.",
      "RESET (I0.1) sets the count back to zero and turns BATCH_READY off; then START begins the next batch."
    ]
  },
  "io": [
    {
      "address": "I0.0",
      "name": {
        "es": "MARCHA",
        "en": "START"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Pulsador de marcha (NA)",
        "en": "Start push button (NO)"
      },
      "mode": "button-no"
    },
    {
      "address": "I0.1",
      "name": {
        "es": "REINICIAR",
        "en": "RESET"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Pulsador para reiniciar el lote (NA)",
        "en": "Batch reset push button (NO)"
      },
      "mode": "button-no"
    },
    {
      "address": "I0.2",
      "name": {
        "es": "SENSOR",
        "en": "SENSOR"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Sensor de cajas (planta)",
        "en": "Box sensor (plant)"
      }
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.0",
      "name": {
        "es": "CINTA",
        "en": "BELT"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Motor de la cinta",
        "en": "Belt motor"
      }
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.1",
      "name": {
        "es": "LOTE_LISTO",
        "en": "BATCH_READY"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Luz de lote listo",
        "en": "Batch ready light"
      }
    }
  ],
  "allowed": [
    "NO",
    "NC",
    "coil",
    "set",
    "reset",
    "P",
    "N",
    "CTU",
    "CTD",
    "CTUD",
    "EQ",
    "NE",
    "LT",
    "GT",
    "LE",
    "GE"
  ],
  "hints": {
    "es": [
      "Un contador CTU cuenta las cajas: suma en cada flanco de subida del sensor.",
      "La salida Q del contador (lote completo) enciende LOTE_LISTO y, con un contacto NC, corta la autorretención de la cinta. REINICIAR va a la entrada R del contador.",
      "Peldaño 1: SENSOR → CTU C0 (PV 3, R = REINICIAR) → LOTE_LISTO. Peldaño 2: (MARCHA O CINTA), NC C0 → CINTA."
    ],
    "en": [
      "A CTU counter counts the boxes: it adds on each rising edge of the sensor.",
      "The counter output Q (batch complete) turns BATCH_READY on and, through an NC contact, breaks the belt seal-in. RESET goes to the counter R input.",
      "Rung 1: SENSOR → CTU C0 (PV 3, R = RESET) → BATCH_READY. Rung 2: (START OR BELT), NC C0 → BELT."
    ]
  },
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "La cinta se detiene sola con la tercera caja",
        "en": "The belt stops by itself with the third box"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 300,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 1000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 5000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 7500,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 9000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "REINICIAR prepara el lote siguiente",
        "en": "RESET prepares the next batch"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 300,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 8000,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 8200,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 8600,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 8800,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 8400,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 9200,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
